        "original_id": "88b69347-6545-582e-aa34-abc742c0c1ca",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tyler Bunch, Jerry Nelson, Peter Linz\n- Characters: Herry Monster\n- TV shows: Person of Interest, Sesame Street\n- Video games: Red Dead Redemption, Grand Theft Auto V, Red Dead Revolver\n- Companies: Rockstar San Diego, Rockstar Games\n\nFacts:\n- Jerry Nelson performed Herry Monster on Sesame Street from 1970 to 2003.\n- Tyler Bunch has acted in a few Off Broadway productions.\n- Tyler Bunch appeared on the American television show Person of Interest.\n- Tyler Bunch appeared in the video games Grand Theft Auto V, Red Dead Redemption, and Red Dead Revolver.\n- In 2013, Tyler Bunch performed Herry Monster.\n- Red Dead Redemption is a Western action-adventure video game developed by Rockstar San Diego and published by Rockstar Games.\n- Since 2017, Peter Linz has performed Herry Monster.",
